{
 "encounter_id": "00817",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sorry, sorry, I'm so late, the bus, then I went to the wrong floor, I thought it was... never mind. It's my heel."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No problem. Which heel? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The right. It's the first steps in the morning, it feels like a nail going in. Heel pain, I mean, when I get out of bed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has it been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Since... the summer? No. The summer before. Or maybe the spring. I honestly can't tell you, it just sort of arrived."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it ease off once you're up? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "After about ten minutes, yes, then it comes back after I've been sitting. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anywhere else in the foot?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Along the arch, a tight ache, yes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Calves?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Very tight, yes. I get cramp after shifts."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any numbness or tingling in the foot?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No numbness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did you twist it or injure it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I never injured it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No swelling, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking for it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Naproxen, maybe 250 mg? Twice a day. And omeprazole, 20 mg, once a day. Every morning. Well, most mornings. I forget it on my days off."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tramadol. I react to it. I've been told. But don't ask me what it does to me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Reflux, flat feet, and carpal tunnel in both wrists."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Surgery?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bunion surgery in 2012. And a hysterectomy in 2019."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother has arthritis in her feet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What's your job?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nurse, twelve-hour shifts on a surgical ward."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I run, parkrun on Saturdays. Or I did."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And on shift?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hard floors all day. About eight miles a shift, the app says."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Blood pressure 128 over 80, weight 82 kilos.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Same as last time? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Same. Sit up on the couch. I'm pressing the heel.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ow! There. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's tenderness at the inner side of the heel, and your calf muscles are very tight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Told you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your arches are flat when you stand."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, always have been. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, I'm fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This looks like plantar fasciitis, but I can't rule out a heel spur."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What's the difference? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A spur is a bony lump you can see on X-ray. I'd like to arrange an X-ray of the foot, and an ultrasound of the heel."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it a long wait? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A few weeks. I'd also like to do blood tests for inflammation, and refer you to a podiatrist for insoles."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. And what do I do meanwhile? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Stretch the calves three times a day, and roll your foot over a frozen water bottle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll try, thank you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If it's not better in six weeks, come back and we'll talk about an injection."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay, six weeks. Sorry again about being late. ~"
  }
 ],
